OL,3,AConservatives pledge 'tough love'
OL,4,Abenefit rules for under-25s
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have said they would
OL,7,Fintroduce new work requirements for
OL,8,Funder-25s claiming benefits in a "tough
OL,9,Flove" approach to youth joblessness.
OL,11,FYoung people claiming Universal Credit
OL,12,Fwho are fit to work but have not worked
OL,13,Ffor six months continuously would face
OL,14,Fnew rules to qualify for payments,
OL,15,Fincluding daily attendance at a job
OL,16,Fcentre or courses.
OL,18,FThe party says the scheme would help
OL,19,Ftackle the almost one million people
OL,20,Faged 16 to 24 in the UK who are not in
OL,21,Feducation, employment or training,
OL,22,Fknown as Neets.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
