OL,3,AConservatives pledge 'tough love'
OL,4,Abenefit rules for under-25s
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut anti-poverty charity Trussell
OL,7,Fwarned that people on Universal Credit
OL,8,Fcould not afford basic essentials,
OL,9,Fwhich harmed their ability to find and
OL,10,Fkeep work.
